---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import pilot from '../data/community-pilot.json';
import '../styles/venue-workspace.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Join the Community | Artists Are Jerks" noindex>
<main class="venue-workspace">
<p>Rogue Valley · Artists Are Jerks</p><h1>Join the community</h1><p>Help people discover artwork they can see in person, and the places that show it.</p>
<p class="notice"><strong>Local prototype:</strong> Applications and invitation acceptance are simulated in this browser. Nothing is emailed or published. Clerk sign-in comes later.</p>
<div class="public-grid" data-join-choices>
<section class="card"><h2>I’m an artist</h2><p>For visual artists, including those showing in restaurants, studios, and other local spaces. This is an art community, rather than a crafts marketplace.</p><button type="button" data-open-artist>Request consideration →</button></section>
<section class="card"><h2>I represent a venue</h2><p>Introduce your space and tell artists you are available to host their work. Administrator approval is required before recruitment tools become available.</p><a class="button" href="/prototype/venues/workspace/">Apply as a venue →</a></section>
</div>
<form class="card" data-artist-application hidden><h2>A little about your work</h2><p>No account or artwork upload is needed to request consideration.</p>
<div class="fields"><label>Artist name<input name="name" required maxlength="150"/></label><label>Private contact email<input name="email" type="email" required/></label><label>Home city<select name="city">{pilot.regions[0].cities.map(city=><option>{city}</option>)}</select></label><label>Practice or media<input name="practice" required placeholder="Painting, drawing, printmaking…" maxlength="200"/></label><label class="full">Website or portfolio <small>optional</small><input name="portfolio" type="text" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="yourwebsite.com"/></label><label class="full">Tell us about your work<textarea name="note" required rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="What do you make, and where can it be seen? If you have no portfolio link, tell us how we can review examples."/></label></div>
<label class="check"><input name="opportunities" type="checkbox"/> After approval, I’d like to receive venue opportunity announcements.</label>
<div class="actions"><button>Submit for consideration</button><button type="button" data-close-artist>Back to choices</button></div><p data-application-error role="status"></p></form>
<section class="card" data-join-result hidden role="status"></section>
<section class="card" data-invitation-panel hidden></section>
<p>Already participating? Sign-in will be added when secure accounts are connected.</p>
<details><summary>Prototype review tools</summary><p><a href="/prototype/admin/artists/">Review artist applications →</a> · <a href="/prototype/admin/venues/">Review venue applications →</a></p><div data-my-applications></div></details>
</main>
<script>
import {initJoin} from '../lib/join-community';initJoin();
</script>
</BaseLayout>
